PS- Design Meeting Scheduler 

Requirements: 
- there are n given meeting rooms 
- Book a meeting in any meeting room at given interveral (start time, end time, capacity) 
- Send notification to all the persons who are invitied to the meeting 
- Use Meeting Room Calendar to track the meetings date and time 


# Condition to book a meeting room : no of people<=capacity of meeting room

# How to write flow first:
You are the user who wants to booka  meeting room

1. User who wants to book the meeting(5 person, start time, end time)  # you can add date as well

2. user asks the meeting scheduler to book a meeting (available rooms)
    2.1 meeting scheduler will check all available rooms from start and end time and capacity of room 
        => getMeetingRoom => fetch call 
        => List<MeetingRooms> getMeetingRoom(requirements)

    2.2 Book a meeting room
    2.3 Block the meeting room booked

3. Send invite notification to all people
    => sendNotification()

User -> MeetingScheduler(st,et,capacity) -> meeting rooms -> check meeting room calendar -> book available meeting room -> send notification

